        "body": "<div>Booked by Sarah Malamut stmala@utu.fi Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting. I was recently funded for a project that will involve a daily diary collection (spanning 15 weekdays). The goal of this study is to assess stressful events that may have occurred that day, and various coping strategies that may have been engaged in (either by themselves or with a friend).</div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<div> </div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: solid 1px #dadce0; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding:0;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:28px;\">\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/ijy-xuim-tkm?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/ijy-xuim-tkm?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\"></a><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; padding: 10px 25px; border: none; margin: 0;\">Join with Google Meet</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Meeting link</h2></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/ijy-xuim-tkm?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/ijy-xuim-tkm?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">meet.google.com/ijy-xuim-tkm</a></div>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>